OL,3,GNEWSANo-burp syndrome sufferer launches
OL,4,Aawareness petition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mum-of-two has started a petition to
OL,7,Fraise awareness of a rare condition
OL,8,Fthat left her unable to burp for most
OL,9,Fof her life.
OL,11,FGemma Renwick, 43, from Eastleigh in
OL,12,FHampshire, has Retrograde
OL,13,FCricopharyngeus Dysfunction (R-CPD)
OL,14,Fthat is also known as no-burp syndrome.
OL,16,FNormally when people eat or drink, they
OL,17,Fswallow small amounts of air that the
OL,18,Fbody releases through a burp. In people
OL,19,Fwith R-CPD, a ring of muscle at the top
OL,20,Fof the food pipe fails to relax and
OL,21,Ftraps gas inside.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
