OL,3,GNEWSANo-burp syndrome sufferer launches
OL,4,Aawareness petition
OL,5,
OL,6,FRenwick said the symptoms can be "just
OL,7,Fhorrendous" and explained "there's not
OL,8,Fordinary bloating, it just gets
OL,9,Fprogressively worse through the day and
OL,10,Fthere's pain in my chest too, where the
OL,11,Fair builds up".
